      "id": "claim_358bd35e09a643b192fdc821844ca16c",
      "statement": "The VolSync Taskfile at .taskfiles/volsync/Taskfile.yaml assumes standardized naming conventions: Fluxtomization, HelmRelease, PVC, and ReplicationSource share the same name, use Restic repositories, and each application has one PVC being replicated.",
